e? If yes, choose an OS-specific measurement approach and a reference machine.) Tj T* (Common Changes, Safely) Tj T* (| Goal | Likely change | Test to add) Tj T* (| Add a quality rule | Add a finding type and field to Analysis; calculate it in analyze;) Tj T* (display it in format_report. | A small mesh that should produce exactly one finding and one) Tj T* (that should not.) Tj T* (| Use tolerance welding | Replace VertexKey policy carefully. Consider spatial buckets) Tj T* (before comparing nearby coordinates. | Vertices inside/outside tolerance; preserved triangle) Tj T* (indices; no unwanted merging at large coordinates.) Tj T* (| Add a primitive | Add a SampleKind variant, dimensions/defaults/validation, generation) Tj T* (function, and generator help text. | Triangle count, finite coordinates, expected bounds,) Tj T* (invalid dimensions.) Tj T* (| Relax ASCII parsing | Change only parse_ascii; keep binary structural detection first. |) Tj T* (Representative export accepted plus malformed input still rejected.) Tj T* (| Reduce memory | Profile before changing data flow. A streaming parser or edge analysis) Tj T* (redesign may help, but must preserve all reports. | Existing suite plus a benchmark) Tj T* (comparison with the same fixture.) Tj T* (Final advice: stay close to the current split: parsing turns bytes into triangles, geometry) Tj T* (turns triangles into an indexed mesh, analysis reads that mesh, and app code handles people) Tj T* (and files. That boundary makes changes easier to reason about and easier for your mentor to) Tj T* (review.) Tj T* ET
